OL,3,AUK to deploy jets to defend Saudi
OL,4,AArabia from Houthi attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK will deploy RAF Typhoon jets to
OL,7,Fdefend Saudi Arabia in response to
OL,8,Fescalating Houthi missile and drone
OL,9,Fattacks, the government has said.
OL,11,FThe defensive mission will help defend
OL,12,FSaudi cities and infrastructure - a
OL,13,Fmove authorised by Prime Minister Andy
OL,14,FBurnham - against aerial attacks by the
OL,15,FIran-backed group.
OL,17,FIt follows Houthi attacks on the Saudi
OL,18,Fcapital Riyadh, as well as on energy
OL,19,Fsites on the country's coast.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
