OL,3,AUK to deploy jets to defend Saudi
OL,4,AArabia from Houthi attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These aircraft will operate in a
OL,7,Fdefensive role and will not conduct
OL,8,Foffensive strikes against the Houthis,"
OL,9,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting said in
OL,10,Fa written statement on Tuesday.
